WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.270
«Ça ne changera rien.»
It won't change anything.

2
00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:07.110
That's one reason young people
who don't vote give in surveys.

3
00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:10.920
Others distrust politicians,
or don't feel represented.

4
00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:15.270
Yet in 2019, school pupils
went on strike for the climate.

5
00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:16.850
Other ways to take part:

6
00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:20.710
«signer une pétition»,
«manifester», «faire du bénévolat».

7
00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:24.700
Four young voters in
ten stayed home in 2022.

8
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:26.270
Have they given up on politics,

9
00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:28.130
or found new ways in?

10
00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:31.250
In this mission, you'll read
a chart of who stayed home,

11
00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:33.030
age group by age group.

12
00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:35.330
Then you'll climb a ladder of engagement,

13
00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:39.020
rung by rung, and debate
«le vote obligatoire».

14
00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:42.080
Your mission: weigh the
evidence and decide:

15
00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:43.890
«motivés ou démotivés»?
